{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00486",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.73,
      "end_seconds": 2.59,
      "duration_seconds": 1.86,
      "text": "Right, hello, please sit down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 3.35,
      "end_seconds": 4.05,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Hello."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 5.01,
      "end_seconds": 8.98,
      "duration_seconds": 3.97,
      "text": "Good morning, doctor. I came along to help out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 10.1,
      "end_seconds": 11.38,
      "duration_seconds": 1.28,
      "text": "Did you come far?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 12.33,
      "end_seconds": 16.97,
      "duration_seconds": 4.64,
      "text": "Not too far, you know, about half an hour by bus."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 18.11,
      "end_seconds": 19.96,
      "duration_seconds": 1.85,
      "text": "So, how have things been?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 21.19,
      "end_seconds": 35.22,
      "duration_seconds": 14.03,
      "text": "Um, so... an itchy rash. That's why I came. It's a relief to finally sit down and talk about it. I looked a few things up online, and that probably didn't help."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 35.98,
      "end_seconds": 40.78,
      "duration_seconds": 4.8,
      "text": "When did you first notice it? I'll explain everything as we go along."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 41.79,
      "end_seconds": 47.76,
      "duration_seconds": 5.97,
      "text": "It's been about four days now. I took the morning off to come in today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 48.98,
      "end_seconds": 50.83,
      "duration_seconds": 1.85,
      "text": "How much is it bothering you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 53.92,
      "end_seconds": 55.25,
      "duration_seconds": 1.33,
      "text": "Mild, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 55.79,
      "end_seconds": 58.97,
      "duration_seconds": 3.18,
      "text": "Alright, anything that tends to go along with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 59.73,
      "end_seconds": 71.49,
      "duration_seconds": 11.76,
      "text": "Right, when it starts I tend to get redness as well. Oh, uh, and itching that wakes me at night. That's been about the same, two months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 72.0,
      "end_seconds": 74.43,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "Have you had dry, scaly patches?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 75.64,
      "end_seconds": 80.94,
      "duration_seconds": 5.3,
      "text": "Yeah, that too. With dry, scaly patches, it's moderate, honestly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 81.6,
      "end_seconds": 83.22,
      "duration_seconds": 1.62,
      "text": "Has there been any fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 84.42,
      "end_seconds": 86.8,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "Yeah, no fever, thank goodness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 87.17,
      "end_seconds": 92.03,
      "duration_seconds": 4.86,
      "text": "Actually, doctor, I did notice fever. She doesn't always say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 92.66,
      "end_seconds": 98.63,
      "duration_seconds": 5.97,
      "text": "No, I don't think I did. Maybe a little, I'm not sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 99.49,
      "end_seconds": 108.17,
      "duration_seconds": 8.68,
      "text": "Alright, I'll note both what you've said and what you've noticed. Have you had any breathing trouble, similar rash in family members or joint pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 111.47,
      "end_seconds": 114.89,
      "duration_seconds": 3.42,
      "text": "No. None of those, um, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 116.44,
      "end_seconds": 119.72,
      "duration_seconds": 3.28,
      "text": "Have you had any new soap or detergent or oozing?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 121.03,
      "end_seconds": 123.8,
      "duration_seconds": 2.77,
      "text": "I mean, nothing like that, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 124.28,
      "end_seconds": 127.09,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "Anything with your nerves, like weakness or numbness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 127.83,
      "end_seconds": 129.71,
      "duration_seconds": 1.88,
      "text": "No, that's all normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 130.71,
      "end_seconds": 133.26,
      "duration_seconds": 2.55,
      "text": "Any long-term health problems I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 133.62,
      "end_seconds": 144.47,
      "duration_seconds": 10.85,
      "text": "I've had asthma, yes. I have eczema, for two years. I wasn't sure whether to come in at all, to be honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 144.82,
      "end_seconds": 162.59,
      "duration_seconds": 17.77,
      "text": "Okay, I'm following. Let me explain how I'm thinking about this. When someone has symptoms like these, we first look for the common and treatable causes, and only then for the rarer ones. That's why I'm going step by step rather than ordering everything at once."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 165.47,
      "end_seconds": 168.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.54,
      "text": "Okay, um, that makes sense."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 168.87,
      "end_seconds": 171.88,
      "duration_seconds": 3.01,
      "text": "Let's go through your medication. What are you taking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 174.22,
      "end_seconds": 189.6,
      "duration_seconds": 15.38,
      "text": "Asthalin inhaler. I take it when needed. I've never really been one for hospitals. Right, I'm on hydrocortisone cream, when needed. Moisturiser. I take it twice a day. I did try to ignore it for a while."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 191.04,
      "end_seconds": 192.94,
      "duration_seconds": 1.9,
      "text": "Any allergies I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 194.46,
      "end_seconds": 196.58,
      "duration_seconds": 2.12,
      "text": "Not that I know, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 197.34,
      "end_seconds": 200.99,
      "duration_seconds": 3.65,
      "text": "I'll try to keep this as efficient as I can."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 203.31,
      "end_seconds": 206.02,
      "duration_seconds": 2.71,
      "text": "Oh, thank you, I appreciate it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 206.66,
      "end_seconds": 209.85,
      "duration_seconds": 3.19,
      "text": "Let's get your blood pressure and the other basics."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 219.31,
      "end_seconds": 220.63,
      "duration_seconds": 1.32,
      "text": "Just relax your arm..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 236.54,
      "end_seconds": 244.77,
      "duration_seconds": 8.23,
      "text": "Okay: temperature 37.0, respiratory rate 16, SpO2 99 percent on room air, heart rate 83, pressure 113 over 81."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 245.19,
      "end_seconds": 246.53,
      "duration_seconds": 1.34,
      "text": "Is that normal?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 247.75,
      "end_seconds": 252.7,
      "duration_seconds": 4.95,
      "text": "We'll put it in context in a moment. Is the room warm enough for you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 254.17,
      "end_seconds": 256.48,
      "duration_seconds": 2.31,
      "text": "Well, it's perfect, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 258.99,
      "end_seconds": 262.77,
      "duration_seconds": 3.78,
      "text": "Alright, I'd like to examine you now. Please come over here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 263.19,
      "end_seconds": 265.26,
      "duration_seconds": 2.07,
      "text": "Yes, um, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 266.9,
      "end_seconds": 269.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.2,
      "text": "Okay, take a breath for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 276.73,
      "end_seconds": 278.8,
      "duration_seconds": 2.07,
      "text": "No signs of infection, no crusting."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 279.74,
      "end_seconds": 282.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "A little pressure here, tell me if it's tender."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 300.28,
      "end_seconds": 304.91,
      "duration_seconds": 4.63,
      "text": "There are dry red patches in the creases of both elbows with scratch marks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 307.0,
      "end_seconds": 322.03,
      "duration_seconds": 15.03,
      "text": "Okay, you can sit back up. From what you've told me and what I found, this looks most like an eczema flare-up. That's my thinking for now, and it may change as we learn more. I can't rule out a fungal infection yet."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 324.48,
      "end_seconds": 327.54,
      "duration_seconds": 3.06,
      "text": "Right, should I be worried about this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 328.11,
      "end_seconds": 343.06,
      "duration_seconds": 14.95,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's an eczema flare-up, and we'll watch how it goes. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had an itchy rash for about four days, mild, and no oozing or similar rash in family members."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 343.45,
      "end_seconds": 346.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.76,
      "text": "Yes, you know, you've got it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 347.29,
      "end_seconds": 376.03,
      "duration_seconds": 28.74,
      "text": "I'll start you on cetirizine, 10 milligrams, at night, for one week. That should help with itching. It's a commonly used medicine and most people tolerate it well. Moisturise right after a bath, thick creams are better than lotions, and use a mild soap. Please take the tablets with food so they don't upset your stomach. Keep an eye out, and if the symptoms get worse, call us the same day or go to emergency."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 376.98,
      "end_seconds": 378.83,
      "duration_seconds": 1.85,
      "text": "Yes, I'll do that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 379.77,
      "end_seconds": 382.64,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "Please come and see me in two weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 382.97,
      "end_seconds": 383.67,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 384.64,
      "end_seconds": 388.71,
      "duration_seconds": 4.07,
      "text": "Just to confirm, what are the next steps as you understand them?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 389.13,
      "end_seconds": 396.51,
      "duration_seconds": 7.38,
      "text": "So, I take the cetirizine, 10 milligrams, at night and come back in two weeks. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 397.24,
      "end_seconds": 401.36,
      "duration_seconds": 4.12,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Okay, I think we're finished. Is everything clear?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 402.05,
      "end_seconds": 403.69,
      "duration_seconds": 1.64,
      "text": "No questions. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0060",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 404.51,
      "end_seconds": 405.39,
      "duration_seconds": 0.88,
      "text": "Alright, goodbye."
    }
  ]
}